07_1351545363214646_5506338495222860567_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=fOLa9f-YAFwQ7kNvwFJsMW4&_nc_oc=Adq2llLbOBsY0vQ3F3y5ITOGuG12_6Fb9rw0JNhMHuUKjnxXVUbM-nehHxNZ6rmhdps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIbtIElMDakRExqN-80o6K8KbB6tmfUT9k90_xyIAaVCg&oe=6ABBC8C2"}, {"file_name": "ss5.png", "id": "1715729295759342", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499305050_1715729299092675_4690986203494255387_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=zD0Igg3SUMQQ7kNvwFY5mwe&_nc_oc=AdriS3RSFOcEqt9dFlHeVAQtEjO22AyMAQLggHdy7WZM6Xjz_S5g-CCBRM0tf_IECRE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJQFLRFoHex661fTkYmXoUuzWF483BN8wvSU5e8kZHYhg&oe=6ABBBE3F"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Portrait.png", "id": "806605711863955", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823486_806605715197288_1898259061609879939_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_PMwMb2da98Q7kNvwFUJ5VN&_nc_oc=AdpHpfhMDcX80jwc3y4QHzsrUrLu5l_VjHgkQhNCjPB1s4RjFNUbOIUsXjK__BVEeQA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJBpFIgfeCyy-5ox31RosZdIJYzg5FRbnnb2ONbUSeyyg&oe=6ABBCD30"}, "display_name": "Afterlife: Dead Zone", "keywords": ["zombies", "shooter", "disparos", "zombis", "horror"], "long_description": "In Afterlife: Dead Zone, you play as a soldier trapped in the Dead Zones, isolated areas where help seems impossible. Humanity teeters on the brink of extinction: ancient alien civilizations have returned to assess our development and, deeming us a threat, unleash weapons of mass destruction that turn people into bloodthirsty monsters.\n\nExplore dark, devastated post-apocalyptic environments where hordes of zombies and mutated creatures can appear around every corner. Your mission is simple but deadly: shoot and avoid dying. While your weapons have infinite ammo, the variety and ferocity of enemies will demand strategy and quic